In-scope (kframe module) counts:

| Item | Before | After | Eliminated |
|------|--------|-------|------------|
| admit() | 0 | 0 | 0 |
| assume() | 0 | 0 | 0 |
| external_body | 1* | 1* | 0 (TCB-allowed) |
